1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,950
Abby. Come here. Like, right now.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,950
That's a guy in a hoodie. From the
side.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,950
That's half of Chicago.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,450
Same ears, though.

5
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:12,950
Jo.

6
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,950
I'm just saying. Ears.

7
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:38,950
¡Mija! Look at you! And who's this?
Flaco, you're too skinny. Sit.

8
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:42,950
Half my students find me on Groupon
now.

9
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:45,950
The other half are her mom's friends.

10
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,950
Ay, no, no, no. Too much masa.

11
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:54,950
You put too much, it all falls apart.

12
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:56,950
Sorry— I'll fix it.

13
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:58,950
Don't fix. Do again.

14
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:04,950
She's been yelling at me since I was
six.

15
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:07,950
And look how good you turned out.

16
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:15,728
My mom took this exact class. Before
she opened her stand on 18th.

17
00:01:15,778 --> 00:01:17,950
What made her do it?

18
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:23,841
Honestly? She was broke and bored and
it was twenty bucks. Fed the whole

19
00:01:23,891 --> 00:01:26,950
block for years off that twenty bucks.

20
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:30,950
I've never made anything. Like… with
my hands. Ever.

21
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:34,950
Well. You made this. It's hideous.

22
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:36,450
It's so hideous.

23
00:01:36,500 --> 00:01:37,950
I love it.

24
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:41,450
Aguas frescas! For— for everyone. On
me.

25
00:01:41,500 --> 00:01:41,950
¡Eso!

26
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:50,950
Fraud alert for Mr. Cole. Thirty-eight
dollars at… Masa Mía?

27
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:52,950
Mr. Cole, please confirm?

28
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:59,950
…Who's Mr. Cole?
